        f"> - **Dataset Evaluation Coverage (`1,069` Unique Evaluation Datasets — `1,000` Shared Regression/Binary + `69` Multiclass; Never Summed to `2,069`):** `DOPE-MLC-v2` is evaluated across **`{d['MlcVTwoDatasets']}` stratified S3 datasets** (`627` regression + `373` binary classification; `65,874` downstream auditor fits; `6,000/6,000` exact `version=2` wire replay cells). `DOPE-MLC-v3` is evaluated across **`{d['MlcVThreeDatasets']}` unique datasets (`{d['MlcVThreeCells']}/4,276` completed dataset-tier cells, `25,656` six-auditor evaluations per domain, `0` failed/missing/duplicate cells)**: the same `1,000` gradient-disjoint `v2`-panel datasets (`628` regression + `372` binary under `v3` intake, `4,000` cells) plus `69` held-out multiclass datasets (`276` cells), within a reconciled `3,859`-dataset catalog (`2,199` `train_gradient`, `112` `dev_val_ablation`, `1,000` `eval_gradient_disjoint_v2_panel`, `69` `eval_gradient_disjoint_multiclass_panel`, `479` explicit exclusions; `0` cross-role `train_sha256` overlaps).",
